    },
    {
      "tag": "F3  the substrate contrast (the pedagogy)",
      "statement": "threshold_freeform's margin over its own bar is LARGER on DISGUISED than on OVERT. FALSE if margin(disguised) <= margin(overt). Requires both arms; the runner computes it whenever both results files exist."
    },
    {
      "tag": "F4  streaming earns its keep",
      "statement": "At some K in EARLY_KS an early-detection AUC beats the confound bar computed on the SAME first-K truncation. FALSE if early_auc(K) <= early_confound(K).worst_auc for every K."
